# 1️⃣2️⃣ Monotonic Stack vs Monotonic Queue

| Feature | Monotonic Stack | Monotonic Queue |
|---------|-----------------|-----------------|
| Structure | Stack | Deque |
| Main Use | Next Greater/Smaller | Sliding Window |
| Removal | Usually from one end | Both ends |
| Common Problems | NGE, Histogram | Sliding Window Maximum |

